  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A kingly posture comes to those who don this iron. The overlapping plates offer a formidable bulwark against the crushing force of hammers and the bite of blades. No foul sorcery can reach the mind of one shielded by such storied metal."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Dull iron plates overlap like the scales of a mountain drake, scarred by many strikes. The harness grips the torso with a stubborn firmness that demands the wearer stand tall against the crushing weight of the world."
    }
  },
